  "notes": "Args shown with .env.dspark.example defaults resolved (compose default host is 127.0.0.1; example sets VLLM_HOST=0.0.0.0). --max-cudagraph-capture-size is computed as ceil8(MAX_NUM_SEQS*(MTP_NUM_TOKENS+1)). Worker runs NODE_RANK=1 HEADLESS=1 with its own VLLM_HOST_IP. Native image input via Vision-Exp ViT hotfix, no video. Weight format: model doc lists 'FP8 weights' quantization metadata (DeepSeek V4 native mixed quant); KV is nvfp4_ds_mla. Optional ABLITERATED=1 applies runtime refusal-direction projection. Stage-C image (Dockerfile.gb10-dsv4-dspark on ghcr.io/miaai-lab/mia-vllm-gb10-linear-b12x:latest) + docker-compose.stage-c.override.yml is an optional 200K/16-slot path (315/205 tok/s claimed with Keys checkpoint), not the default. Boot log: 17.04 GiB KV / 2,331,430 tokens.",
